<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Learn Coptic</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+Coptic&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 16px; }
    .coptic { font-family: 'Noto Sans Coptic', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin: 8px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Learn Coptic</h1>
  <h2>Lesson 1: Letters</h2>
  <div class="card"><span class="coptic">Ⲁ ⲁ</span> Alpha, sounds like "a"</div>
  <div class="card"><span class="coptic">Ⲃ ⲃ</span> Vida, sounds like "v"</div>
  <div class="card"><span class="coptic">Ⲅ ⲅ</span> Gamma, sounds like "g"</div>
</body>
</html>
